    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Prince</strong>: You will play as a person chosen by a divine system, transported to become the prince of a rising small country, New Han. In this world filled with opportunities and challenges, you will complete your university education discreetly and then begin to develop your country using the powers granted by the divine system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine System Powers</strong>: The system endows you with extraordinary abilities, including acquiring vast wealth, recruiting top-tier talent, and developing energy resources. You will use these powers to solve various problems facing your country and propel New Han towards prosperity and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296520/extras/c52f241606981431c7530d0296ffecf2.avif?t=1739260080\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise of a Business Empire</strong>: You will quickly rise in the financial and entertainment industries, making shrewd business decisions that earn you immense wealth. Your success not only garners you a reputation but also lays a solid foundation for New Han's economic development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love and Choices</strong>: Beautiful actresses and the sexy investment assistant will vie for your attention. How will you handle your relationships with them? This is one of the critical decisions you will face in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296520/extras/ce18e193fbd8448fcafdd0102869ca12.avif?t=1739260080\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsibility for National Development</strong>: Beyond commercial competition, you must also navigate complex family dynamics and political challenges. How will you balance your personal life with the heavy responsibility of national development and lead New Han to a brighter future?</p>",
